","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-2-nice-and-clear-view"],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you prepared you Xcode project and integrated OUDS Swift Package, you can now define a nice and clear view with headings, images and button.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"Components showcases","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase"],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Since you discovered tokens, colors, spacings, and view modifiers, now it’s time to integrate and play with some components!","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"Go further with more ressources","tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-4-going-further"],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can have questions and issues, and there are resources online. Let’s see that together.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"content":[],"kind":"volume","name":null,"image":null}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase":{"abstract":[{"text":"Now you are ready to use more components than a simple button!","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-onboarding-3-components-showcase","role":"project","kind":"project","type":"topic","title":"Components showcase","estimatedTime":"1hr 0min"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-onboarding-1-package-and-librairies":{"abstract":[{"text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These librairies help to s